hypotheses.body:
## Statement
Surface-space regional mapping removes persistent illumination collapse and retains changing separated trajectories on the saved Shpongle motion.

## Rationale
Analytic ray-plane projection and emitted DMX reproduce collapse before this run. Nominal target separation is not footprint separation. Controls reject common point, static spread, jitter, translation and flashing but accept separated changing trajectories. This is not a generator qualification.

## Plan
/mnt/lightsem-data/experiments/lightsem/motion_native_audio_20260910/delivery/surface_revision_01/design_preregistered.json

## Links
Tests problem [[dancing-light-generative-20260903]].
Applies [[motion-light-surface-mapping]].
Predicts [[motion-light-surface-horizontal-span]] (up).
